    "sentence_translations": [
      "What Do You Do At The Gym",
      "",
      "Lucy: Ning Ning, I haven’t seen you in months. You look much more energetic.",
      "",
      "Ning Ning: Yes, that’s because I started going to the gym. Twice every week.",
      "",
      "Lucy: What do you usually do at the gym?",
      "",
      "Ning Ning: I like to run on the treadmill, and then use training equipment to exercise my pecs and abs.",
      "",
      "Lucy: I also want to work out, but I don’t like to use training equipment. I think it’s boring.",
      "I like exercise where you have music and can dance.",
      "",
      "Ning Ning: Aerobics?",
      "",
      "Lucy: Yes yes, just like that.",
      "",
      "Ning Ning: The gym I go to has aerobics, yoga, Zumba and other classes. You can try it out.",
      "",
      "Lucy: Really? Then I’ll go check it out some other day.",
      ""
    ]
